{"id":"vezde","lemma":"везде","pos":"adv","rank":747,"glosses":["everywhere","anywhere","throughout"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я везде смотрел.","en":"I looked everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926546","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to look, to gaze","l":"смотреть"}]},{"text":"Везде была кровь.","en":"Blood was everywhere.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"blood"}]},{"text":"«Где болит?» — «Везде».","en":"\"Where does it hurt?\" \"Everywhere.\"","words":[{"g":"where"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы тебя везде ищем.","en":"We've been looking all over for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274844","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to look for, to seek","l":"искать"}]},{"text":"Везде были камеры.","en":"Cameras were everywhere.","words":[null,{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"camera","l":"камера"}]}]}